  "details": "Implementing XR_EXT_hand_tracking would provide a one-size-fits-all API for hand points which covers both Quest's hand tracking as well as Ultraleap on PC, Vive Cosmos, Varjo and a handful of other mobile headsets.\nCurrently on PC, VRChat only supports the SteamVR/Index 'curl' values for hand tracking. Some apps like Virtual Desktop emulate Index controllers for Quest, but this limits some gestures such as crossing fingers.\nXR_EXT_hand_tracking would also improve other SteamVR controllers which use capacitive sensors, buttons, jotsticks, etc to provide approximate hand poses, since SteamVR provides its skeletal poses to XR_EXT_hand_tracking.\nPossibly a duplicate of https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/hand-tracking-on-quest-support-in-the-future",
